			"type": "Line",
			"value": " A lone `.prop` off a call WITH ARGUMENTS takes no break point when the chain sits",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 104
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " directly under an assignment or a declarator — prettier's `printMemberExpression`",
			"start": 106,
			"end": 190
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " call-object clause (member.js `shouldInline`). The width sheds into the call's",
			"start": 192,
			"end": 273
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " arguments instead of dropping the lookup to a line of its own.",
			"start": 275,
			"end": 340
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " a declarator initializer",
			"start": 343,
			"end": 370
		},
