			"value": " an assignment value — the same position",
			"start": 500,
			"end": 542
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " an optional lookup is the same clause — the walk steps over the `ChainExpression`",
			"start": 675,
			"end": 759
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " NOT the clause: the call has no arguments, so the lookup keeps its break point",
			"start": 890,
			"end": 971
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " NOT the clause: two lookups, so the last one's object is a member and not the call",
